I"�N<p><a href="https://www.acmicpc.net/problem/1062">1062번: 가르침</a></p>

<h3 id="어떤-문제인가">어떤 문제인가</h3>

<p>남극 문자로 된 단어 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">N</code>개가 있는데, 모든 단어는 <strong><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">anta</code>로 시작해서 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">tica</code>로 끝난다.</strong>
알파벳 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">K</code>개만 가르칠 수 있을 때, 학생들이 <strong>읽을 수 있는 단어 수를 최대</strong>로 만드는 문제다.</p>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">N</code>은 최대 50, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">K</code>는 0 이상 26 이하다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="문제의-절반은-조건에서-풀린다">문제의 절반은 조건에서 풀린다</h3>

<p>모든 단어가 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">anta</code>로 시작하고 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">tica</code>로 끝난다는 건, 어떤 단어를 읽든 <strong><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">a, n, t, i, c</code> 다섯 글자는 무조건 알아야 한다</strong>는 뜻이다.</p>

<p>여기서 두 가지가 바로 나온다.</p>

<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">K &lt; 5</code>이면 단어를 하나도 읽을 수 없으므로 <strong>답은 무조건 0</strong></li>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">K &gt;= 5</code>이면 다섯 글자를 미리 배운 것으로 두고, <strong>남은 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">K-5</code>개를 21글자 중에서 고르는 문제</strong>로 줄어든다</li>
</ul>

<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">K</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">5</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="n">cout</span> <span class="o">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="k">return</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'a'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'n'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'t'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'i'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'c'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>입력을 받을 때 앞뒤 고정 부분을 아예 잘라내는 것도 같은 맥락이다.</p>

<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">].</span><span class="n">substr</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">].</span><span class="n">size</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="mi">8</span><span class="p">);</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">anta</code>(4글자)와 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">tica</code>(4글자)를 떼면 판단해야 할 부분만 남는다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="왜-백트래킹인가">왜 백트래킹인가</h3>

<p>“21글자 중 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">K-5</code>개를 고르는 모든 조합”을 봐야 하고, 어떤 조합이 최적인지는 <strong>다 세어봐야 안다.</strong>
글자 사이에 우선순위 같은 게 없어서 그리디가 통하지 않는다.</p>

<p>최악의 경우 26개 중 절반쯤을 고르는 조합이라 수가 꽤 되지만, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">N</code>이 50이고 단어 길이도 짧아서 통과한다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="조합을-만드는-방식">조합을 만드는 방식</h3>

<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">depth</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">26</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="k">continue</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="n">dfs</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">k</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">);</span>
    <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">depth</code>부터 시작하는 게 포인트다.
0부터 돌면 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">{b, d}</code>와 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">{d, b}</code>를 서로 다른 경우로 세게 되는데, 우리가 원하는 건 순열이 아니라 <strong>조합</strong>이다.
시작 인덱스를 넘겨주면 항상 뒤쪽 글자만 고르게 되어 중복이 사라진다.</p>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">check[i] = false</code>로 되돌리는 것이 백트래킹이다. 이걸 빼면 한번 켠 글자가 다른 분기에도 남는다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="접근-방식">접근 방식</h3>

<p>dfs를 돌면서 문자 하나씩 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">true</code>로 바꿔주며, 매번 모든 단어를 확인해 읽을 수 있는 단어를 세고 최댓값을 갱신했다.</p>

<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">N</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="kt">bool</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">j</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">j</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">].</span><span class="n">size</span><span class="p">();</span> <span class="n">j</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">][</span><span class="n">j</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="k">continue</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="k">break</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="p">}</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">tf</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">count</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>단어의 모든 글자가 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">check</code>에 들어 있으면 읽을 수 있다는 판정이다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="시간-복잡도">시간 복잡도</h3>

<p>조합의 수에 매번 단어를 세는 비용 <strong>O(N × 단어 길이)</strong> 가 곱해진다.
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">K-5</code>개를 21글자 중에서 고르는 조합이 최대 수십만 수준이고 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">N</code>이 50이라 제한 안에 들어온다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="배운-점">배운 점</h3>

<p>어렵지 않게 풀 수 있었던 문제였다. <strong>dfs를 응용하는 법</strong>에 대해 잘 알 수 있었다.</p>

<p>다른 사람의 풀이를 보니 <strong>각 단어를 26비트 정수로 바꿔두는</strong> 방식이 있었다.
단어마다 “어떤 글자를 쓰는가”를 비트마스크로 미리 만들어두면, 매번 문자열을 훑지 않고 비트 연산 한 번으로 판정할 수 있다.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>(단어비트 &amp; ~배운비트) == 0  →  읽을 수 있음
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>문자열 비교를 정수 연산으로 바꾸는 셈이라 시간이 크게 줄어든다. 이런 방식도 인지해두어야겠다.</p>

<p>같은 백트래킹 유형인 <a href="/baekjoon/2026/08/01/백준-17136-색종이-붙이기.html">17136 색종이 붙이기</a>와 비교하면, 이 문제는 <strong>고정 조건을 먼저 걷어내 탐색 범위를 줄이는 것</strong>이 핵심이었다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<hr />

<div class="language-cpp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="cp">#include &lt;iostream&gt;
#include &lt;algorithm&gt;
</span>
<span class="k">using</span> <span class="k">namespace</span> <span class="n">std</span><span class="p">;</span>

<span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">N</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">K</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">result</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">string</span> <span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">50</span><span class="p">];</span>
<span class="n">string</span> <span class="n">word</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">50</span><span class="p">];</span>
<span class="kt">bool</span> <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">26</span><span class="p">];</span>

<span class="kt">void</span> <span class="nf">dfs</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">depth</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">k</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">k</span> <span class="o">&gt;</span> <span class="n">K</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="k">return</span><span class="p">;</span>

    <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">count</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>

    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">N</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
        <span class="kt">bool</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">j</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">j</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">].</span><span class="n">size</span><span class="p">();</span> <span class="n">j</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
            <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">][</span><span class="n">j</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="k">continue</span><span class="p">;</span>

            <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
            <span class="k">break</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="p">}</span>

        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">tf</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">count</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="p">}</span>

    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">k</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="n">K</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
        <span class="n">result</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">max</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">count</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">result</span><span class="p">);</span>
        <span class="k">return</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="p">}</span>

    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">depth</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">26</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="k">continue</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="n">dfs</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">k</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">);</span>
        <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="p">}</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="kt">void</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">K</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">5</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
        <span class="n">cout</span> <span class="o">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="k">return</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="p">}</span>

    <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'a'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'n'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'t'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'i'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="n">check</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="sc">'c'</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'a'</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>

    <span class="n">dfs</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">5</span><span class="p">);</span>

    <span class="n">cout</span> <span class="o">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="n">result</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="kt">int</span> <span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="n">ios_base</span><span class="o">::</span><span class="n">sync_with_stdio</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">);</span>
    <span class="n">cin</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">tie</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">NULL</span><span class="p">);</span> <span class="n">cout</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">tie</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">NULL</span><span class="p">);</span>

    <span class="n">cin</span> <span class="o">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class="n">N</span> <span class="o">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class="n">K</span><span class="p">;</span>

    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">N</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
        <span class="n">cin</span> <span class="o">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class="n">s</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">];</span>
